OL,3,GNEWSAMayor gains new powers over venue
OL,4,Alicences
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Mayor of London has been given the
OL,7,Fpower to intervene in some licensing
OL,8,Fdecisions, in a move supporters say
OL,9,Fwill benefit the capital's nightlife
OL,10,Fand hospitality sectors.
OL,12,FFrom Monday, Sadiq Khan can intervene
OL,13,Fin licensing applications deemed
OL,14,Fstrategically important to London,
OL,15,Fallowing him to review council
OL,16,Fdecisions and make the final ruling.
OL,18,FLord Khan said the "new licensing
OL,19,Fpowers create an opportunity to further
OL,20,Fchampion London's amazing venues,
OL,21,Fparticularly our hospitality industry".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
