OL,3,GNEWSAMayor gains new powers over venue
OL,4,Alicences
OL,5,
OL,6,FCritics argue the powers - which could
OL,7,Fapply to large venues, live music,
OL,8,Flater opening hours, festivals and
OL,9,Fmajor events - could take
OL,10,Fdecision-making away from local
OL,11,Fauthorities.
